      "label": "CPU",
      "aliases": [
        "中央處理器"
      ],
      "summary": "執行指令與回應中斷的處理器；可把大量資料搬運工作交給 DMA。",
      "status": "active",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evidence_os_dma",
        "evidence_os_interrupt"
      ],
      "group_id": "group_os_hardware_events"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept_dma",
      "label": "直接記憶體存取",
      "aliases": [
        "DMA"
      ],
      "summary": "在磁碟與記憶體之間直接搬運資料，讓 CPU 主要處理初始設定與完成通知的機制。",
      "status": "active",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evidence_os_dma"
      ],
      "group_id": "group_os_hardware_events"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept_driver",
      "label": "驅動程式",
      "aliases": [
        "Driver"
      ],
      "summary": "對應特定硬體、負責處理其事件與操作細節的程式。",
      "status": "active",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evidence_os_interrupt"
      ],
      "group_id": "group_os_hardware_events"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept_interrupt",
      "label": "中斷",
      "aliases": [
        "Interrupt"
      ],
      "summary": "硬體元件向 CPU 發出的服務訊號，使 CPU 暫停目前任務、保存狀態並處理事件。",
      "status": "active",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evidence_os_interrupt"
      ],
      "group_id": "group_os_hardware_events"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept_kernel_mode",
      "label": "核心模式",
      "aliases": [
        "Kernel Mode"
      ],
      "summary": "允許核心執行受保護硬體操作的高權限處理器模式。",
      "status": "active",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "evidence_os_protection"
      ],
      "group_id": "group_os_protection_boundary"
    },
    {
      "id": "concept_lock",
      "label": "鎖",
      "aliases": [
        "Lock"
      ],
      "summary": "限制共享資料同時被多個執行緒修改，以避免操作互相交錯。",
